WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.289 --> 00:00:03.970
So I've been hearing some tension between you and your roommate lately.

1
00:00:04.739 --> 00:00:05.170
Yeah,

2
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.650
it's really frustrating.

3
00:00:07.019 --> 00:00:09.470
I feel like I'm doing all the work on our project,

4
00:00:09.659 --> 00:00:11.810
and she just blames me for being bossy.

5
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.520
That sounds tough.

6
00:00:13.899 --> 00:00:16.059
Have you had a chance to talk to her about it?

7
00:00:16.719 --> 00:00:17.600
I tried,

8
00:00:17.879 --> 00:00:19.420
but she just deflects,

9
00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.379
saying I don't let her contribute.

10
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.469
It's like she's not even trying.

11
00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.069
I can relate.

12
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.659
I had a similar experience with her on a group project last semester.

13
00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.130
It was really challenging to get everyone on the same page.